{"kind": "event", "event": {"schema_version": 1, "session_id": "eaa106263ba74894aa90ecf7fdb3e187", "seq": 21, "turn": 0, "elapsed_ms": 23303.639249992557, "kind": "thinking", "text": "The user asked what targets Package.swift declares. Let me list them."}}
{"kind": "event", "event": {"schema_version": 1, "session_id": "eaa106263ba74894aa90ecf7fdb3e187", "seq": 22, "turn": 0, "elapsed_ms": 23303.68875002023, "kind": "narration", "text": "`Package.swift` declares **six targets**:\n\n**Libraries**\n1. **`SwiftStarKit`** — a library target (also exposed as the `SwiftStarKit` product).\n2. **`SwiftStarEngine`** — depends on `SwiftStarKit`.\n3. **`SwiftStarUI`** — depends on `SwiftStarKit`, `SwiftStarEngine`, and the external `MarkdownView`/`MarkdownParser` products; uses the `mainActor` settings. Also exposed as the `SwiftStarUI` product (so Xcode can generate a previews scheme).\n\n**Executable**\n4. **`SwiftStar`** — an executable target depending on `SwiftStarUI`, processing `Resources`, using the `mainActor` settings.\n\n**Tests**\n5. **`SwiftStarKitTests`** — test target depending on `SwiftStarKit`.\n6. **`SwiftStarIntegrationTests`** — test target depending on `SwiftStarKit`, `SwiftStarEngine`, and `SwiftStarUI`; uses the `mainActor` settings."}}
